    "message": "Update agent-platform-migrate-from-ai-studio and gemini-agents-api skills\n\n- agent-platform-migrate-from-ai-studio: Query `project/numeric-project-id` from the Compute Engine metadata server, use the `roles/aiplatform.user` IAM role identifier, update SDK and ADK model examples to `gemini-3.5-flash`, and update the ADK Agent Platform documentation link.\n- gemini-agents-api: Update the `base_agent` example identifier to `antigravity-preview-09-2026` and reference the `gemini-interactions-api` skill by name.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1022802953",
